WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.562
Sometimes the goal is to build one readable field
from several columns CONCAT_WS

00:00:07.576 --> 00:00:13.103
means concatenate with separator It is especially
useful when some

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:20.610
components can be NULL because it avoids producing
unnecessary separators for missing arguments NULLIF

00:00:20.637 --> 00:00:26.282
can convert an empty string to NULL first That
combination helps create

00:00:26.308 --> 00:00:28.795
clean display lines without confusing blanks
